#/** @file
#
#  Armbian (U-Boot): ask the SPL to boot Armbian's own U-Boot once, then
#  restart.  Registered as a boot option by PlatformBootManagerLib on boards
#  that set RK_ARMBIAN_ONCE_ENABLE.  See docs/ARMBIAN-CHAINLOAD.md.
#
#  Copyright (c) 2026, Jiaxing Hu <gahing@gahingwoo.com>
